Upstream-bound: no
Subject: [PORT_HOST] P3.4 auto menu return

DW3_AUTO_MENU_RETURN=<frames> requests GAME.fieldMode after a menu overlay
runs (disabled while DW3_FORCE_MCARD_SAVE is set).

--- a/src/engine/system/overlay.c
+++ b/src/engine/system/overlay.c
@@ -71,6 +71,46 @@
                 }
